<title>USA: H.D. Vest unit fined $1.7 mln by NASD panel.</title>
<headline>H.D. Vest unit fined $1.7 mln by NASD panel.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, Texas 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>H.D. Vest Inc said on Thursday that its subsidiary, H.D. Vest Investment Securities Inc, was found liable by an NASD arbitration panel for actual and punitive damages of about $1.7 million.</p>
<p>H.D. Vest said it is reviewing the award to consider whether or not it will appeal.</p>
<p>The fine is the result of actions taken by a former employee who the company said was previously discharged.</p>
</text>
